1
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:15,410
Ying, look.

2
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:19,450
Ying, eat up.

3
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,610
It's very sweet.

4
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,620
Ever since I was a child, I knew

5
00:00:23,830 --> 00:00:25,020
that in this family,

6
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:26,280
my sister needed to be favored

7
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,220
more than I did.

8
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:31,320
But she always felt

9
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:32,670
that she was taking away

10
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:35,000
the love our parents should have given me.

11
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,390
Give it to us.

12
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:37,350
-So...
-Give it to us.

13
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:38,960
she lived her life as an umbrella

14
00:00:38,960 --> 00:00:40,920
to shelter me from the wind and rain,

15
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,210
making sure I got twice

16
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:44,590
as much of all the good things.

17
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,840
This is my brother.

18
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,360
If any of you dare to bully him again,

19
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:48,890
I won't let you off!

20
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:50,520
All these years, she has been

21
00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:52,110
protecting me.

22
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:54,640
Now I also want to be

23
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:56,350
the one who can protect her.

24
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:28,740
[Light the Dark]

25
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:31,890
[Episode 6]

26
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:51,960
Ying.

27
00:02:52,430 --> 00:02:53,430
The food is ready.

28
00:02:55,210 --> 00:02:55,900
Coming.

29
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,690
Bring them to the table.

30
00:03:02,590 --> 00:03:03,360
Here.

31
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:06,700
Where is your stool?

32
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:09,610
I'm happy today.

33
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:10,790
We can have a drink

34
00:03:10,790 --> 00:03:11,800
with Mom and Dad.

35
00:03:21,970 --> 00:03:23,390
Don't pour too much.

36
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:34,910
Here.

37
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:44,680
Dad, Mom.

38
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,720
Wan Yang committed suicide.

39
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,560
The evil forces have fallen.

40
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,760
Today, my sister and I

41
00:03:51,579 --> 00:03:52,880
can finally hold our heads high

42
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:54,210
and raise a glass to you.

43
00:03:55,030 --> 00:03:55,980
Shan.

44
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,360
Promise me.

45
00:03:57,470 --> 00:03:59,590
Don't talk about these things anymore.

46
00:03:59,590 --> 00:04:01,050
Everything is in the past.

47
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,000
The two of us

48
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:03,890
just need to look ahead.

49
00:04:04,710 --> 00:04:05,750
I haven't told you yet,

50
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:06,430
Dad, Mom.

51
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:10,410
My sister has left the plant now.

52
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:12,360
Whether she can go back or not,

53
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,470
you two

54
00:04:13,910 --> 00:04:15,430
must bless her

55
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,829
so her path ahead

56
00:04:16,829 --> 00:04:17,829
will be smoother.

57
00:04:17,829 --> 00:04:18,490
Bottoms up.

58
00:04:19,070 --> 00:04:20,440
What are you doing?

59
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:22,720
Don't just ask them to bless me.

60
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,870
Tell them to bless both of us.

61
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,920
Hurry up and try it.

62
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:27,240
See if the food is good.

63
00:04:27,830 --> 00:04:29,000
It must be good.

64
00:04:29,190 --> 00:04:31,840
My brother's cooking is great now.

65
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,290
I suddenly remembered something.

66
00:04:41,870 --> 00:04:43,270
Do you remember when we were kids

67
00:04:43,270 --> 00:04:45,750
and the power went out?
I was afraid of the dark.

68
00:04:45,750 --> 00:04:47,550
How did you comfort me back then?

69
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,860
I said...

70
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,220
You're the little man

71
00:04:54,220 --> 00:04:55,070
of our family.

72
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,790
How can you be so timid?

73
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:00,240
When you grow up...

74
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:02,240
You'll have to protect Mom and Dad,

75
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,510
and me, too.

76
00:05:04,270 --> 00:05:05,510
Besides that,

77
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:07,040
you told me something else.

78
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:09,120
You told me

79
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:12,240
that darkness never lasts forever.

80
00:05:12,240 --> 00:05:13,510
Even when there's no light,

81
00:05:13,510 --> 00:05:14,910
there's always a candle.

82
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,940
And if the candle goes out,

83
00:05:17,270 --> 00:05:19,270
the sun will rise eventually.

84
00:05:20,510 --> 00:05:21,550
Dawn

85
00:05:22,310 --> 00:05:23,950
will light up everything.

86
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:30,000
As long as there's light in your heart,

87
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,690
you can light up the darkness.

88
00:05:33,510 --> 00:05:35,640
As long as there's light in your heart,

89
00:05:37,159 --> 00:05:38,820
you can light up the darkness.

90
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,600
Face whatever comes your way

91
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:45,850
-And keep moving forward.
-and keep moving forward.

92
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:47,750
Ying.

93
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,610
Let me ask you something then.

94
00:05:51,390 --> 00:05:52,770
Do you really think

95
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:55,950
a candle can light up the dark?

96
00:05:57,350 --> 00:05:58,240
Can we really

97
00:05:59,159 --> 00:06:00,110
overcome every obstacle

98
00:06:00,110 --> 00:06:01,320
in this world?

99
00:06:09,310 --> 00:06:10,560
Stop drinking.

100
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:12,270
I think you're drunk.

101
00:06:12,410 --> 00:06:14,340
You're starting to talk nonsense.

102
00:06:14,650 --> 00:06:15,650
No more drinking.

103
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:16,630
Eat something.

104
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,720
Ying.

105
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,630
Promise me.

106
00:06:21,070 --> 00:06:23,170
No matter what happens in the future,

107
00:06:23,830 --> 00:06:25,490
I will always be your brother.

108
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,270
Silly, silly, silly.

109
00:06:30,270 --> 00:06:32,150
I don't know what you're thinking.

110
00:06:32,150 --> 00:06:34,430
Come on, eat up.

111
00:06:34,430 --> 00:06:35,430
No more drinking.

112
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:36,430
Hurry up!

113
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:38,960
No more drinking.

114
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,900
Just one glass.

115
00:06:43,159 --> 00:06:44,390
Drink one with me.

116
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:47,960
You're so disobedient.

117
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,220
After this one, no more drinking.

118
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:51,930
You need to help me tomorrow.

119
00:06:52,040 --> 00:06:52,920
To my sister!

120
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,690
To my brother.

121
00:07:02,330 --> 00:07:03,580
[A Warm Send-Off
for the Investigation Team]

122
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:04,510
I will definitely support his work.

123
00:07:04,830 --> 00:07:05,830
Stop messing around!

124
00:07:05,830 --> 00:07:06,920
Make way! Make way!

125
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,070
Come on! Make way!

126
00:07:08,190 --> 00:07:08,830
Make way! Make way!

127
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:09,750
Make way! Make way!

128
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:10,190
Make way! Make way!

129
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:10,790
Applause!

130
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:23,400
The investigation team is going back.

131
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,680
Don't forget

132
00:07:24,680 --> 00:07:26,750
what you promised me last night, Ying.

133
00:07:26,750 --> 00:07:28,410
I will always be your brother.

134
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,530
Keep up the good work. Goodbye.

135
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,490
Team Leader Pan.

136
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,750
-What are you doing? The leaders are talking.
-What are you doing?

137
00:07:34,750 --> 00:07:35,240
Don't go forward.

138
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,240
-Team Leader Pan! Team Leader Pan!
-Don't go forward!

139
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,040
What are you doing?

140
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,190
I am Chen Fu's son!

141
00:07:38,190 --> 00:07:39,650
Don't stop him. Let him in.

142
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:43,760
Team Leader Pan.

143
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,190
I am the son of Chen Fu,

144
00:07:45,190 --> 00:07:47,000
who died in the line of duty
in the recent explosion.

145
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,680
My name is Chen Shan.

146
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,620
Nice to meet you, Chen.

147
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,650
Nice to meet you.

148
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,600
I want to thank the investigation team

149
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,240
for your continued

150
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:56,040
help and support for our family.

151
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,000
It's what we should do.

152
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,240
Today,

153
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,570
there's something else I want to tell you.

154
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:05,690
I want to report something!

155
00:08:05,830 --> 00:08:06,630
Report?

156
00:08:06,630 --> 00:08:07,510
Report?

157
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:13,140
My mother, Zhang Wenying,

158
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:14,750
wasn't withholding information

159
00:08:14,750 --> 00:08:16,360
about Wan Yang's corruption case.

160
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,690
She was coerced by Wan Yang
for a long time!

161
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:19,600
How did he...

162
00:08:19,600 --> 00:08:20,190
Chen.

163
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,880
How did he coerce her?

164
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:24,180
More than 20 years ago,

165
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:25,360
a mistake in the blueprints

166
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,830
designed by my mother, Zhang Wenying,

167
00:08:26,830 --> 00:08:28,430
led to an explosion
at a construction site,

168
00:08:28,430 --> 00:08:29,920
killing my sister Chen Ying's

169
00:08:29,920 --> 00:08:31,120
biological parents.

170
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,080
I've heard about this before.

171
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,179
Back then, Wan Yang

172
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,669
covered up the incident

173
00:08:35,669 --> 00:08:37,240
and classified it as an accident,

174
00:08:37,240 --> 00:08:38,720
saving my mother from punishment.

175
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,440
From then on, my mother, Zhang Wenying,

176
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,380
had to do

177
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:42,630
whatever he said.

178
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:47,910
Team Leader Pan, please take a look.

179
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,930
This is the real investigation report

180
00:08:49,030 --> 00:08:49,940
[Liability Determination Report]

181
00:08:50,270 --> 00:08:51,720
on that accident.

182
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:52,910
My sister Chen Ying

183
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,750
was originally named Peng Xiaoyun.

184
00:08:54,750 --> 00:08:56,540
Her biological father was Peng Da,

185
00:08:56,540 --> 00:08:58,080
and her biological mother was Feng Lan.

186
00:08:58,080 --> 00:09:00,510
In 1978, they were killed in an explosion

187
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:02,120
during a mountain blasting operation

188
00:09:02,120 --> 00:09:03,270
for a geological survey
in the Gobi Desert.

189
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,330
After that,

190
00:09:04,480 --> 00:09:06,000
my parents adopted her

191
00:09:06,390 --> 00:09:07,850
and renamed her Chen Ying.

192
00:09:08,270 --> 00:09:09,670
By rights, she should be recognized

193
00:09:09,670 --> 00:09:11,150
as a family member of employees

194
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:12,270
who died in the line of duty.

195
00:09:12,270 --> 00:09:13,150
She shouldn't be implicated

196
00:09:13,150 --> 00:09:14,480
because of my mother,

197
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,270
Zhang Wenying.

198
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:16,360
It's not fair!

199
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,880
Yes, it's not fair!

200
00:09:17,960 --> 00:09:18,970
Team Leader Pan.

201
00:09:19,270 --> 00:09:20,790
Everyone knows how capable

202
00:09:20,790 --> 00:09:22,620
my sister Chen Ying

203
00:09:22,650 --> 00:09:23,640
is at work!

204
00:09:23,670 --> 00:09:25,930
The plant shouldn't have dismissed her!

205
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,110
And her

206
00:09:28,130 --> 00:09:29,260
biological parents

207
00:09:29,270 --> 00:09:30,810
died in the line of duty.

208
00:09:31,270 --> 00:09:32,910
So shouldn't the plant, by rights,

209
00:09:32,910 --> 00:09:34,480
give the house to her

210
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:36,000
as compensation,

211
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,200
instead of taking it back

212
00:09:37,200 --> 00:09:38,530
like they're doing now?

213
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:39,750
Don't you all agree?

214
00:09:39,750 --> 00:09:40,320
Yes!

215
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:43,270
It should be returned to her!

216
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:43,960
Chen,

217
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:45,150
since this is the case,

218
00:09:45,150 --> 00:09:46,750
let's go inside

219
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,750
and talk about it in detail.

220
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:50,270
Okay.

221
00:09:50,910 --> 00:09:52,080
Come on! Make way!

222
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,790
Move along!

223
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:49,030
Mr. Qi.

224
00:11:54,670 --> 00:11:56,130
I'll go in first by myself.

225
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,120
You're back?

226
00:12:15,910 --> 00:12:17,510
One more dish and we can eat.

227
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,000
Ying.

228
00:12:29,870 --> 00:12:30,630
The investigation team

229
00:12:30,630 --> 00:12:31,790
has already agreed.

230
00:12:32,670 --> 00:12:35,000
You can be removed
from our family register

231
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,550
and then registered as a family member

232
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:38,270
of employees who died in the line of duty.

233
00:12:38,270 --> 00:12:38,960
Then you can

234
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,000
keep the current house

235
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:41,510
and your job

236
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,960
as Peng Xiaoyun.

237
00:12:43,510 --> 00:12:44,240
You will have a

238
00:12:44,240 --> 00:12:45,440
very good future.

239
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,000
Time to eat.

240
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,640
Why are you standing there? Eat.

241
00:13:34,550 --> 00:13:37,010
The day I tracked down
Wan Yang's warehouse,

242
00:13:38,360 --> 00:13:40,470
he was waiting for me downstairs.

243
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:44,630
He gave me the documents
about what happened

244
00:13:44,630 --> 00:13:46,630
to your biological parents.

245
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:48,480
I didn't believe it at the time,

246
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:50,280
so I rushed home to confront Mom.

247
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:54,850
She didn't deny it.

248
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,240
Ever since then,

249
00:13:58,240 --> 00:14:01,040
every time
you mentioned investigating Wan Yang,

250
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,790
I'd get nervous.

251
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:05,600
I wanted to investigate,

252
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:06,920
but I was even more afraid that Wan Yang

253
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:08,490
would tell you everything.

254
00:14:08,550 --> 00:14:09,440
I forgot to add salt.

255
00:14:09,440 --> 00:14:10,080
Ying.

256
00:14:10,510 --> 00:14:11,360
Ying.

257
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,150
Can you say something?

258
00:14:25,870 --> 00:14:27,270
Mom and Dad are both gone.

259
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:29,770
You're all I have left.

260
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,320
I really don't want to see you

261
00:14:36,390 --> 00:14:37,600
get implicated

262
00:14:37,600 --> 00:14:38,600
because of them.

263
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:40,320
I don't want to see you

264
00:14:40,320 --> 00:14:41,390
suffer every day over things

265
00:14:41,390 --> 00:14:43,450
you never should have had to bear.

266
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:45,320
You know how I feel

267
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:47,120
every time I see you

268
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:48,200
pretending everything's fine,

269
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:49,860
forcing a smile in front of me?

270
00:14:50,390 --> 00:14:51,630
I can't stand it.

271
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,510
I really can't.

272
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:56,920
I want you to be okay.

273
00:14:57,150 --> 00:14:59,960
I want you to have a good future.

274
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,790
I want you

275
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:02,550
to have at least a normal life.

276
00:15:02,550 --> 00:15:04,220
All I want is for you to be okay!

277
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,360
Look at them.

278
00:15:17,320 --> 00:15:18,150
They are the people

279
00:15:18,150 --> 00:15:20,410
I've called Mom and Dad for over 20 years.

280
00:15:20,870 --> 00:15:21,630
They gave me

281
00:15:21,630 --> 00:15:22,960
a happy home.

282
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:24,120
They're the people

283
00:15:24,150 --> 00:15:25,750
I've loved for over 20 years!

284
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:30,490
And what are you doing now?

285
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:34,550
You're tearing my life apart.

286
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,750
You're tearing apart the life

287
00:15:36,750 --> 00:15:38,750
I've lived for over 20 years!

288
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,320
Now tell me.

289
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:43,960
Who are they?

290
00:15:45,150 --> 00:15:45,960
Who are they?

291
00:15:47,390 --> 00:15:48,650
Are they the people who gave me happiness

292
00:15:48,650 --> 00:15:50,850
or the people who brought me suffering?

293
00:15:52,270 --> 00:15:54,150
You knew all this long ago.

294
00:15:55,440 --> 00:15:57,200
Why didn't you tell me earlier

295
00:15:58,670 --> 00:16:00,080
so I could've seen you
for what you really are

296
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:01,350
and stayed away from you?

297
00:16:01,350 --> 00:16:02,750
Why did you suddenly come forward

298
00:16:02,750 --> 00:16:04,150
and say all this now?

299
00:16:04,510 --> 00:16:05,630
I have no parents,

300
00:16:05,630 --> 00:16:06,630
no job, no future.

301
00:16:06,630 --> 00:16:08,150
I can only make a living by selling socks.

302
00:16:08,150 --> 00:16:09,080
You despise me.

303
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:10,720
You think I'm useless

304
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,720
and an embarrassment to you, right?

305
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:13,630
Fine.

306
00:16:13,960 --> 00:16:14,750
Leave.

307
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,690
Leave here.

308
00:16:18,710 --> 00:16:19,630
Go to Guangzhou

309
00:16:19,650 --> 00:16:21,010
and be an engineer!

310
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:22,870
Get out!

311
00:16:23,270 --> 00:16:24,190
Get out!

312
00:17:55,440 --> 00:17:57,500
I didn't want to face all this either.

313
00:18:00,380 --> 00:18:01,750
But it's all true.

314
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:07,720
I had a big fight with Mom that day.

315
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,160
Mom died because of me.

316
00:18:21,790 --> 00:18:23,070
Chen Shan. Wait.

317
00:18:23,090 --> 00:18:23,720
What...

318
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:25,280
What are you doing?

319
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:25,960
Come on.

320
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:27,540
Talk to your sister.

321
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:29,480
Well...

322
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,760
Well... Chen Shan...

323
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,270
Chen Shan.

324
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:37,750
Chen Shan!

325
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:40,210
Chen Shan, where are you going? Chen Shan!

326
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,400
To be honest with you,

327
00:19:13,680 --> 00:19:14,680
in my heart,

328
00:19:16,310 --> 00:19:17,920
I really feel that no one in this world

329
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:19,250
is good enough for Ying,

330
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:22,240
including you.

331
00:19:24,270 --> 00:19:26,200
But there are no other options now.

332
00:19:28,070 --> 00:19:29,790
You're all she has left now.

333
00:19:35,030 --> 00:19:37,090
When I'm not around her in the future,

334
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,800
please spend more time with her.

335
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,800
Can you promise me one thing, Mo?

336
00:19:50,400 --> 00:19:51,310
From now on, you must

337
00:19:51,310 --> 00:19:52,550
take good care of her.

338
00:19:54,550 --> 00:19:55,440
I don't want her to

339
00:19:55,440 --> 00:19:57,100
be treated unfairly anymore.

340
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,400
Not even a little bit.

341
00:20:02,790 --> 00:20:03,590
Okay?

342
00:20:13,480 --> 00:20:14,270
Chen Shan.

343
00:20:15,720 --> 00:20:16,590
I understand

344
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:19,130
what you're saying.

345
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:21,960
From now on,

346
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:23,720
we are family.

347
00:20:26,110 --> 00:20:27,770
Let's have a bottle of baijiu.

348
00:20:49,350 --> 00:20:50,440
Get me that

349
00:20:50,440 --> 00:20:51,350
Laobaigan.

350
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:52,160
Okay.

351
00:21:29,480 --> 00:21:30,270
Chen Ying.

352
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,290
Why are you drinking?

353
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:55,350
This watch

354
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:00,930
was a gift from the Chen family.

355
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,700
Thank you, Mom and Dad.

356
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,000
From now on,

357
00:22:07,510 --> 00:22:08,830
I'll wear this watch.

358
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,070
They wanted to tell me

359
00:22:16,830 --> 00:22:19,230
that I was
the Chen family's real daughter.

360
00:22:21,510 --> 00:22:22,310
But...

361
00:22:25,440 --> 00:22:27,400
what does this even mean?

362
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:30,680
Did they really cause

363
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:32,790
my real parents' deaths?

364
00:22:35,960 --> 00:22:37,200
Did they really use

365
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:39,730
the same hands
that killed my parents to weave

366
00:22:40,270 --> 00:22:43,150
a web of lies
and make me believe I was happy?

367
00:22:43,790 --> 00:22:45,400
Then who am I?

368
00:22:47,440 --> 00:22:49,000
I am... I am...

369
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:51,030
Am I the daughter of the victims,

370
00:22:51,030 --> 00:22:53,640
or am I the child of the killers?

371
00:23:04,750 --> 00:23:07,010
They are all dead.

372
00:23:08,270 --> 00:23:10,240
I don't even know what happened.

373
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,750
What really happened?

374
00:23:11,750 --> 00:23:14,130
Who can tell me the truth?

375
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:19,940
Chen Ying.

376
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,000
Ying.

377
00:23:25,900 --> 00:23:26,930
Qi Mo...

378
00:23:29,640 --> 00:23:30,680
Qi Mo...

379
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,920
Take me away.

380
00:23:34,350 --> 00:23:35,440
Take me away.

381
00:23:36,350 --> 00:23:38,770
Take me away from here, okay?

382
00:23:39,880 --> 00:23:41,690
Take me away from here.

383
00:23:43,270 --> 00:23:46,400
Take me away from here, okay?

384
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:56,830
Take me away from here.

385
00:24:18,960 --> 00:24:19,750
Shan.

386
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:21,480
Yiming. Auntie.

387
00:24:21,790 --> 00:24:22,590
Shan?

388
00:24:23,720 --> 00:24:25,110
It's so late. What are you...

389
00:24:25,110 --> 00:24:25,920
Can I...

390
00:24:27,440 --> 00:24:28,830
stay here...

391
00:24:28,960 --> 00:24:29,760
for a few days?

392
00:24:30,550 --> 00:24:32,420
Just a few days. I'll leave soon.

393
00:24:32,470 --> 00:24:33,880
What are you talking about?

394
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:34,720
Of course you can.

395
00:24:34,720 --> 00:24:35,310
Yeah.

396
00:24:35,310 --> 00:24:37,080
Stay as long as you want.

397
00:24:37,240 --> 00:24:37,790
Thank you, Auntie.

398
00:24:37,790 --> 00:24:39,030
We have a folding bed.

399
00:24:39,200 --> 00:24:40,510
You two can share a room.

400
00:24:40,510 --> 00:24:41,680
-No problem.
-Hurry up and tidy things up.

401
00:24:41,680 --> 00:24:43,340
I'll go tidy things up for you.

402
00:24:43,790 --> 00:24:44,640
Shan, you...

403
00:24:44,640 --> 00:24:46,030
As long as you don't mind our house,

404
00:24:46,030 --> 00:24:47,760
you can stay as long as you want.

405
00:24:48,350 --> 00:24:50,210
Where did you get the motorcycle?

406
00:24:50,960 --> 00:24:52,030
You mean this one?

407
00:24:52,680 --> 00:24:54,880
Lu went to work in Shenzhen,

408
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:55,830
so he asked me to help him

409
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:57,270
look after this motorcycle.

410
00:24:57,270 --> 00:24:58,880
Shan, if you're free,

411
00:24:58,960 --> 00:25:00,610
let's go for a ride, shall we?

412
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:04,000
Never mind.

413
00:25:06,160 --> 00:25:08,270
Actually, about what happened
at the plant gate today,

414
00:25:08,270 --> 00:25:09,440
I heard about it.

415
00:25:09,830 --> 00:25:11,440
Did you have a fight with Ying

416
00:25:11,640 --> 00:25:12,750
and get kicked out?

417
00:25:15,000 --> 00:25:15,920
I'm fine.

418
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,130
What's important is my sister.

419
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:26,880
She must be feeling terrible right now.

420
00:25:39,790 --> 00:25:40,550
Xiaoyun.

421
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,880
This is your father's watch

422
00:25:43,900 --> 00:25:45,900
that we found at the accident scene.

423
00:26:40,550 --> 00:26:43,000
I've been thinking about something
all night,

424
00:26:43,000 --> 00:26:44,110
and I must tell you.

425
00:26:45,000 --> 00:26:46,200
You may not know this,

426
00:26:47,830 --> 00:26:49,450
but the first time I saw you

427
00:26:49,470 --> 00:26:50,600
in Master's office,

428
00:26:51,350 --> 00:26:52,350
you smiled at me,

429
00:26:53,920 --> 00:26:55,270
and it was like the sun

430
00:26:56,270 --> 00:26:57,680
had lit up my life.

431
00:26:59,830 --> 00:27:01,830
I want to take care of you from now on.

432
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:03,720
Rest assured.

433
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,750
If you're with me,

434
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:08,880
you won't have to do any work

435
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:11,240
or wait on me.

436
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:12,770
I'll always treat you well.

437
00:27:17,240 --> 00:27:18,480
I made this for you...

438
00:27:19,830 --> 00:27:21,070
in a hurry.

439
00:27:23,000 --> 00:27:24,270
When we get married,

440
00:27:26,350 --> 00:27:27,880
I'll give you a real one.

441
00:27:29,790 --> 00:27:30,880
Will you marry me?

442
00:27:31,840 --> 00:27:34,090
♪ You guess, I guess ♪

443
00:27:34,190 --> 00:27:36,370
♪ You say, I say ♪

444
00:27:36,480 --> 00:27:39,780
♪ Longing can consume us ♪

445
00:27:39,800 --> 00:27:42,140
♪ No asking, no crying ♪

446
00:27:42,160 --> 00:27:44,210
♪ No thinking, no speaking ♪

447
00:27:44,300 --> 00:27:48,170
♪ The haze slowly clears away ♪

448
00:27:48,210 --> 00:27:50,830
♪ Being wild, acting spoiled ♪

449
00:27:50,850 --> 00:27:52,630
♪ Unchanged, undefeated ♪

450
00:27:52,740 --> 00:27:56,180
♪ Growing up starts right now ♪

451
00:27:56,360 --> 00:27:58,370
♪ Don't look back ♪

452
00:27:58,480 --> 00:28:00,500
♪ You see, I see ♪

453
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:04,160
♪ The sun is rising ♪

454
00:28:03,790 --> 00:28:04,590
Ying.

455
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:06,420
No one understands you

456
00:28:07,440 --> 00:28:09,070
better than I do right now.

457
00:28:12,720 --> 00:28:14,120
Master was a good person.

458
00:28:15,030 --> 00:28:16,310
So was Mr. Chen.

459
00:28:17,920 --> 00:28:18,880
I don't

460
00:28:19,510 --> 00:28:20,510
understand

461
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:23,830
♪ Your smile is so beautiful ♪

462
00:28:21,440 --> 00:28:23,030
why they lied to you.

463
00:28:24,610 --> 00:28:28,480
♪ It guards the beat of my heart ♪

464
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,880
Don't you want to know

465
00:28:25,880 --> 00:28:27,160
the truth?

466
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:33,080
♪ Time keeps running on ♪

467
00:28:31,550 --> 00:28:32,350
Ying,

468
00:28:33,230 --> 00:28:36,750
♪ Your arms are soft and warm ♪

469
00:28:33,510 --> 00:28:35,320
you told me last night

470
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:36,880
that you wanted to leave here.

471
00:28:36,850 --> 00:28:41,360
♪ I see the stars smiling ♪

472
00:28:39,590 --> 00:28:40,850
But we can't leave now.

473
00:28:41,490 --> 00:28:44,970
♪ I hear the wind playfully sigh ♪

474
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:43,340
Think about it.

475
00:28:45,240 --> 00:28:46,640
I'm the plant director now.

476
00:28:45,660 --> 00:28:49,190
♪ Time is still burning bright ♪

477
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,440
I have a chance to help you

478
00:28:49,420 --> 00:28:58,250
♪ Lighting up the lonely souls
in this world ♪

479
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:50,880
uncover the truth.

480
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:55,750
You can find out

481
00:28:56,550 --> 00:28:57,550
what really caused

482
00:28:57,550 --> 00:28:59,480
your biological parents' deaths.

483
00:29:04,880 --> 00:29:05,640
Ying.

484
00:29:07,590 --> 00:29:08,880
If we leave now,

485
00:29:10,750 --> 00:29:12,550
we may never get another chance.

486
00:29:36,110 --> 00:29:38,690
[Marriage Registration Office]

487
00:29:39,840 --> 00:29:42,260
[Name: Peng Xiaoyun]

488
00:29:46,400 --> 00:29:48,160
After discussing the matter,
the plant leadership

489
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:49,550
has decided that,
since your sister's biological parents

490
00:29:49,550 --> 00:29:50,680
died in the line of duty,

491
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:51,550
the plant

492
00:29:52,200 --> 00:29:53,630
will allocate this house to her

493
00:29:53,630 --> 00:29:54,670
as compensation.

494
00:29:55,270 --> 00:29:57,530
Your sister has decided to give the house

495
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:58,640
to you instead,

496
00:29:58,790 --> 00:30:01,550
as a way of repaying the Chen family

497
00:30:01,640 --> 00:30:02,920
for raising her.

498
00:30:03,640 --> 00:30:04,790
When the time comes,

499
00:30:04,920 --> 00:30:06,160
you can move back in.

500
00:30:10,510 --> 00:30:12,030
Then can my sister...

501
00:30:13,550 --> 00:30:14,350
k-keep her job

502
00:30:14,350 --> 00:30:15,590
at the plant?

503
00:30:16,030 --> 00:30:16,830
Of course.

504
00:30:17,440 --> 00:30:18,240
The paperwork for her return

505
00:30:18,240 --> 00:30:19,310
is already being processed.

506
00:30:19,310 --> 00:30:20,200
Once it's done,

507
00:30:20,510 --> 00:30:21,770
she can go back to work.

508
00:30:24,350 --> 00:30:26,480
How is she doing now?

509
00:30:28,110 --> 00:30:29,590
She's actually doing quite well.

510
00:30:29,590 --> 00:30:30,400
Don't worry.

511
00:30:34,350 --> 00:30:35,160
That's good.

512
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:40,510
You need to give her more time,

513
00:30:40,590 --> 00:30:41,550
okay?

514
00:30:42,440 --> 00:30:43,830
I came here today for two reasons.

515
00:30:43,830 --> 00:30:44,390
First,

516
00:30:44,410 --> 00:30:45,680
to tell you about the house.

517
00:30:45,680 --> 00:30:46,510
Second,

518
00:30:47,030 --> 00:30:48,240
to thank you.

519
00:30:48,590 --> 00:30:50,400
If you hadn't encouraged me

520
00:30:50,400 --> 00:30:51,640
before you left,

521
00:30:52,270 --> 00:30:53,470
your sister and I

522
00:30:54,920 --> 00:30:56,250
wouldn't have gotten together

523
00:30:56,250 --> 00:30:57,410
so soon.

524
00:30:57,790 --> 00:30:58,590
Well,

525
00:30:58,720 --> 00:31:00,590
your sister and I have been through

526
00:31:00,590 --> 00:31:02,590
so many ups and downs

527
00:31:02,750 --> 00:31:04,270
at home and in the plant.

528
00:31:04,640 --> 00:31:07,040
Now that things have finally settled down,

529
00:31:07,070 --> 00:31:08,450
I want

530
00:31:08,750 --> 00:31:10,480
to give her

531
00:31:11,550 --> 00:31:13,630
a proper wedding ceremony.

532
00:31:13,750 --> 00:31:14,570
I think

533
00:31:14,590 --> 00:31:15,910
she'll be thrilled.

534
00:31:18,680 --> 00:31:19,440
Yeah.

535
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:22,540
She will definitely be happy.

536
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:26,890
That's very thoughtful of you, Mo.

537
00:31:27,720 --> 00:31:28,500
I've been thinking

538
00:31:28,500 --> 00:31:30,300
that you're the key to this.

539
00:31:30,590 --> 00:31:31,440
I know neither of you

540
00:31:31,440 --> 00:31:32,970
wanted things

541
00:31:33,480 --> 00:31:35,350
to turn out this way.

542
00:31:36,550 --> 00:31:38,490
But I know your sister now.

543
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:39,830
You're the one

544
00:31:40,200 --> 00:31:41,550
she's always been

545
00:31:41,550 --> 00:31:42,680
worried about.

546
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:45,440
So I was thinking,

547
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:46,880
if you could come

548
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:48,720
to our wedding,

549
00:31:48,830 --> 00:31:49,510
firstly,

550
00:31:50,160 --> 00:31:52,020
it would be a great support for me.

551
00:31:52,070 --> 00:31:53,330
And secondly, your sister

552
00:31:53,330 --> 00:31:54,430
would feel much more at ease

553
00:31:54,430 --> 00:31:55,560
and be really happy.

554
00:31:55,750 --> 00:31:57,270
It'd also be a way of giving us

555
00:31:57,270 --> 00:31:58,740
your blessing.

556
00:31:58,830 --> 00:31:59,830
What do you think?

557
00:32:03,110 --> 00:32:04,770
When are you getting married?

558
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,240
Tomorrow,

559
00:32:08,110 --> 00:32:10,000
at the plant cafeteria.

560
00:32:17,270 --> 00:32:18,600
I'll be there tomorrow.

561
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,440
Great.

562
00:32:22,030 --> 00:32:23,090
Then it's perfect.

563
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:24,310
I just wanted to tell you this.

564
00:32:24,310 --> 00:32:25,440
I'll go prepare now.

565
00:32:25,880 --> 00:32:26,400
Okay.

566
00:32:26,720 --> 00:32:27,580
Come tomorrow.

567
00:32:30,040 --> 00:32:30,690
Director Qi.

568
00:32:30,690 --> 00:32:31,450
Yiming.

569
00:32:31,750 --> 00:32:32,950
What brings you here?

570
00:32:33,200 --> 00:32:34,200
I came to see Shan.

571
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:37,400
How... is your injury?

572
00:32:38,830 --> 00:32:39,830
I'm much better.

573
00:32:39,830 --> 00:32:40,680
Thank you, Director.

574
00:32:40,680 --> 00:32:41,440
Rest well,

575
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:43,900
and come back to work
when you've recovered.

576
00:32:44,960 --> 00:32:45,750
I'm leaving.

577
00:32:45,920 --> 00:32:48,580
Let the organization know
if you need anything.

578
00:34:03,110 --> 00:34:04,740
Time to eat. Time to eat!

579
00:34:04,870 --> 00:34:06,830
Look at what delicious food my dad made.

580
00:34:06,830 --> 00:34:08,699
Authentic Chen Fu noodles.

581
00:34:08,760 --> 00:34:09,510
Smells so good.

582
00:34:09,510 --> 00:34:10,880
Is it the Sichuan pepper I bought?

583
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:11,909
Yes.

584
00:34:12,150 --> 00:34:13,480
This Sichuan pepper
has a really authentic flavor.

585
00:34:13,480 --> 00:34:15,050
Buy it from the same shop next time.

586
00:34:15,050 --> 00:34:16,909
Okay, bring my son's noodles now.

587
00:34:17,150 --> 00:34:18,920
His class won't end
for a few more minutes.

588
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:19,880
I'll cook his noodles when he gets back.

589
00:34:19,880 --> 00:34:21,400
Otherwise, they'll get soggy.

590
00:34:21,400 --> 00:34:22,230
There are two more dishes.

591
00:34:22,230 --> 00:34:23,300
You guys eat first.

592
00:34:24,030 --> 00:34:25,489
Food's best when it's hot.

593
00:34:26,480 --> 00:34:27,280
Smells so good.

594
00:34:27,280 --> 00:34:27,840
Right?

595
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:28,380
Yes.

596
00:34:28,670 --> 00:34:30,989
So delicious!

597
00:35:08,550 --> 00:35:10,660
Yiming, time to eat.

598
00:35:14,070 --> 00:35:15,480
Here, have a bun.

599
00:35:19,800 --> 00:35:20,720
Mom.

600
00:35:21,150 --> 00:35:23,210
I need to talk to you about something.

601
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:25,190
I'm thinking of changing jobs.

602
00:35:25,190 --> 00:35:27,520
I'm planning to go to Guangdong with Shan.

603
00:35:27,960 --> 00:35:29,710
Wait. Why?

604
00:35:30,030 --> 00:35:31,360
Shan got a job offer

605
00:35:31,360 --> 00:35:32,430
from Guangdong Petrochemical.

606
00:35:32,430 --> 00:35:34,290
I want to go with him to try my luck.

607
00:35:34,360 --> 00:35:35,190
No.

608
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:37,000
Isn't it nice here?

609
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:38,730
Why go all the way to Guangdong?

610
00:35:40,030 --> 00:35:42,150
What's so nice about staying here, Mom?

611
00:35:42,150 --> 00:35:43,880
You don't know what's going on.

612
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:46,320
Mom.

613
00:35:48,150 --> 00:35:49,550
Let me tell you the truth.

614
00:35:49,630 --> 00:35:51,040
Don't you think
all the things that have happened lately

615
00:35:51,040 --> 00:35:52,030
are suspicious?

616
00:35:52,400 --> 00:35:53,960
Boss died because of me.

617
00:35:54,030 --> 00:35:55,050
When Shan and Ying

618
00:35:55,080 --> 00:35:56,810
were investigating his death,

619
00:35:57,190 --> 00:35:58,400
Mrs. Zhang suddenly killed herself

620
00:35:58,400 --> 00:35:59,230
for no apparent reason.

621
00:35:59,230 --> 00:36:00,400
Now, these two siblings

622
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,400
have fallen out

623
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,550
for some unknown reason.

624
00:36:02,550 --> 00:36:03,800
Sun Jie was arrested.

625
00:36:04,190 --> 00:36:05,920
Wan Yang jumped off a building.

626
00:36:06,190 --> 00:36:07,280
But do you really think they can arrest

627
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,410
everyone involved?

628
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:10,630
If anything happens to Shan,

629
00:36:11,440 --> 00:36:13,100
how am I supposed to face Boss?

630
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:14,360
Are you saying...

631
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:15,730
Shan is in danger?

632
00:36:17,230 --> 00:36:18,510
That's why I've been trying
to persuade him

633
00:36:18,510 --> 00:36:19,880
to leave Wugang as soon as possible.

634
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:20,230
So...

635
00:36:20,280 --> 00:36:21,800
when are you leaving?

636
00:36:22,710 --> 00:36:24,640
We're planning to leave tomorrow.

637
00:36:26,440 --> 00:36:27,230
Tomorrow?

638
00:36:28,480 --> 00:36:29,920
So Shan will leave

639
00:36:29,920 --> 00:36:31,920
after his sister's wedding.

640
00:36:33,800 --> 00:36:34,880
Wedding?

641
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:37,160
Who is Ying marrying?

642
00:36:37,400 --> 00:36:38,440
Director Qi.

643
00:36:40,190 --> 00:36:41,770
Ying is marrying Qi Mo?

644
00:36:42,480 --> 00:36:43,230
When?

645
00:36:43,230 --> 00:36:44,550
It's at noon.

646
00:36:44,550 --> 00:36:45,800
Haven't you heard?

647
00:36:45,800 --> 00:36:47,600
The plant is bustling right now.

648
00:36:49,230 --> 00:36:50,030
No.

649
00:36:50,670 --> 00:36:52,330
No, no.

650
00:36:53,320 --> 00:36:55,320
Have a bun before you go!

651
00:36:55,480 --> 00:36:56,070
You...

652
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:58,870
Drive slowly!

653
00:36:59,190 --> 00:37:00,440
Be careful!

654
00:37:08,400 --> 00:37:08,960
Dad.

655
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:14,480
Mom.

656
00:37:19,230 --> 00:37:19,840
Ying.

657
00:37:21,400 --> 00:37:23,400
I'm proposing another toast today.

658
00:37:26,760 --> 00:37:28,000
But this time, there really is

659
00:37:28,000 --> 00:37:28,940
good news.

660
00:37:32,430 --> 00:37:33,830
Ying is getting married.

661
00:37:41,650 --> 00:37:43,450
Qi Mo is quite nice.

662
00:37:44,280 --> 00:37:45,910
He has promised me

663
00:37:46,590 --> 00:37:48,850
that he will definitely treat Ying well.

664
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:51,320
So rest assured.

665
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:54,400
Drink up without worrying.

666
00:37:58,440 --> 00:37:59,630
This toast...

667
00:38:03,320 --> 00:38:04,320
is to Ying.

668
00:38:08,510 --> 00:38:10,110
Let's have a drink

669
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:11,280
with Ying.

670
00:38:13,440 --> 00:38:14,030
Dad.

671
00:38:16,440 --> 00:38:17,030
Mom.

672
00:38:23,000 --> 00:38:24,030
How come I didn't know

673
00:38:24,030 --> 00:38:25,580
you could knit sweaters?

674
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:26,670
This... How...

675
00:38:26,670 --> 00:38:27,910
Let me see. Let me see.

676
00:38:33,440 --> 00:38:35,440
I told you not to move...

677
00:38:40,960 --> 00:38:42,230
I wish you happiness.

678
00:39:01,960 --> 00:39:02,630
Let's eat.

679
00:39:30,400 --> 00:39:31,000
Shan!

680
00:39:33,110 --> 00:39:33,760
Shan.

681
00:39:34,280 --> 00:39:35,410
There's something

682
00:39:35,760 --> 00:39:37,110
I haven't told you.

683
00:39:37,400 --> 00:39:39,190
I've thought about it for a long time.

684
00:39:39,190 --> 00:39:40,400
I must tell you.

685
00:39:41,710 --> 00:39:42,520
Go ahead.

686
00:39:42,550 --> 00:39:44,210
The morning of the explosion,

687
00:39:44,800 --> 00:39:47,070
I saw Qi Mo outside the valve pit.

688
00:39:48,030 --> 00:39:49,920
But he seemed completely different

689
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,480
from usual that day.

690
00:39:51,840 --> 00:39:52,480
When I woke up

691
00:39:52,480 --> 00:39:53,630
in the hospital,

692
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:55,360
I found out that Boss

693
00:39:55,550 --> 00:39:57,480
and Director Zhang were both dead.

694
00:39:57,590 --> 00:39:58,880
I was terrified.

695
00:39:59,990 --> 00:40:01,880
Designers don't usually need to be

696
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:03,520
at the scene during emergency repairs.

697
00:40:03,520 --> 00:40:04,400
I'm not sure

698
00:40:04,510 --> 00:40:05,890
if Qi Mo's presence had anything to do

699
00:40:05,890 --> 00:40:07,020
with the explosion.

700
00:40:07,030 --> 00:40:08,440
I was afraid I might be wrong about him.

701
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:10,510
Now that Qi Mo has become the director,

702
00:40:10,510 --> 00:40:12,230
I find this whole thing more and more

703
00:40:12,230 --> 00:40:13,380
suspicious.

704
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:15,230
Shan,

705
00:40:16,030 --> 00:40:17,960
Qi Mo is going to marry your sister.

706
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:19,710
No matter what,

707
00:40:20,190 --> 00:40:21,030
I feel I have to tell you

708
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:21,760
about this.

709
00:40:24,150 --> 00:40:25,480
I'm going to confront him.

710
00:40:25,480 --> 00:40:26,280
Shan.

711
00:40:27,960 --> 00:40:29,360
Lend me your motorcycle.

712
00:40:29,630 --> 00:40:31,030
Shan, I'm going with you!

713
00:40:41,230 --> 00:40:42,400
Godfather.

714
00:40:42,550 --> 00:40:43,360
Chen Shan?

715
00:40:44,490 --> 00:40:46,150
He is not answering his phone.

716
00:40:47,110 --> 00:40:48,280
Go on, go on.

717
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:49,440
I'll keep calling him.

718
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:50,440
Go greet the guests.

719
00:40:50,440 --> 00:40:51,440
It's almost time.

720
00:40:51,440 --> 00:40:52,590
Okay, I know. I know.

721
00:40:52,590 --> 00:40:53,390
Go greet them.

722
00:40:57,510 --> 00:40:58,190
Eat up, guys.

723
00:40:58,190 --> 00:40:59,490
Eat up.

724
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:01,360
Congratulations.

725
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:02,230
Thank you.

726
00:41:02,290 --> 00:41:03,260
Thank you.

727
00:41:03,290 --> 00:41:04,630
Okay, thank you. Thank you.

728
00:41:04,630 --> 00:41:05,440
Eat up.

729
00:41:05,440 --> 00:41:06,630
Eat up and enjoy.

730
00:41:06,630 --> 00:41:08,110
Director, congratulations.

731
00:41:08,110 --> 00:41:09,110
Congratulations.

732
00:41:09,110 --> 00:41:09,510
Thank you.

733
00:41:09,510 --> 00:41:10,960
Right away.

734
00:41:10,160 --> 00:41:16,250
[Wedding]

735
00:41:14,510 --> 00:41:16,440
How about we wait a little longer?

736
00:41:33,110 --> 00:41:33,880
It's such

737
00:41:34,030 --> 00:41:36,360
a joyous occasion today.

738
00:41:36,480 --> 00:41:37,480
Later, I'll make sure

739
00:41:37,480 --> 00:41:39,150
to raise a few more toasts to everyone.

740
00:41:39,150 --> 00:41:39,670
How does that sound?

741
00:41:39,670 --> 00:41:41,030
Bravo!

742
00:41:44,880 --> 00:41:46,540
He's not answering the phone.

743
00:41:47,320 --> 00:41:48,280
Perfect timing.

744
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:50,230
I'd like to take this opportunity

745
00:41:50,230 --> 00:41:52,670
to thank you all for your

746
00:41:52,760 --> 00:41:56,770
continued care and support
for Xiaoyun and me.

747
00:41:57,280 --> 00:41:58,030
Go up there!

748
00:41:58,280 --> 00:41:59,070
Sit tight!

749
00:42:08,760 --> 00:42:10,000
Thank you all

750
00:42:10,070 --> 00:42:13,360
for coming to celebrate

751
00:42:13,440 --> 00:42:15,480
my wedding day with me.

752
00:42:19,230 --> 00:42:20,690
Let's not wait any longer.

753
00:42:21,030 --> 00:42:22,150
Let's get started.

754
00:42:23,000 --> 00:42:23,390
Okay.

755
00:42:23,410 --> 00:42:24,410
Hello, everyone.

756
00:42:25,550 --> 00:42:26,650
On this

757
00:42:26,920 --> 00:42:28,920
beautiful autumn day,

758
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:31,920
we're here to celebrate the wedding

759
00:42:31,920 --> 00:42:34,590
of Director Qi and Chen Ying.

760
00:42:34,710 --> 00:42:35,710
For him,

761
00:42:35,710 --> 00:42:38,030
this is a very important day.

762
00:42:52,510 --> 00:42:53,320
Chen Ying.

763
00:42:54,800 --> 00:42:56,230
Will you marry me

764
00:42:57,000 --> 00:42:59,800
and spend the rest of your life with me?

765
00:43:06,920 --> 00:43:09,070
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

766
00:43:12,280 --> 00:43:14,740
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

767
00:43:14,770 --> 00:43:17,860
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

768
00:43:17,860 --> 00:43:20,720
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

769
00:43:20,720 --> 00:43:23,900
Marry him! Marry him! Marry him!

770
00:43:29,400 --> 00:43:30,400
I will.

771
00:44:12,320 --> 00:44:14,700
Director Qi! Director Geng!
Something's happened!

772
00:44:14,700 --> 00:44:16,430
What's all the shouting about?

773
00:44:17,960 --> 00:44:18,800
Hold on! Hold on!

774
00:44:18,800 --> 00:44:19,510
Chen Ying,

775
00:44:19,550 --> 00:44:20,400
your brother's been in a car accident.

776
00:44:20,400 --> 00:44:21,800
He's been taken to the hospital!
